Scoped Psion 3 audio (wve) demuxer

The magic probe, the 32-byte header layout (duration rb32 at offset 18,
data from offset 32 to EOF) and the A-law 8000 Hz mono stream parameters in
src/wve.ts follow libavformat/wvedec.c (wve_probe, wve_read_header); packets
and their span follow libavformat/pcm.c (ff_pcm_default_packet_size,
ff_pcm_read_packet).
